@startuml

title An agent grant is active until its person revokes it or its time runs out

[*] --> active : the person creates the grant
active --> revoked : the person or an administrator revokes it
active --> expired : its expiry passes
revoked --> [*]
expired --> [*]

note right of active
  A lapsed person, disabled or removed,
  is refused at each exchange; the grant
  itself does not change state.
end note

@enduml
